{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>A stronghold for the blameless</b> — it is a noun on the pattern of לחם חום or the lamed, like בעבור, and it is a noun." "<b>The way of YHWH</b> — His commandments." "<b>And destruction</b> — it is the way that destroys them because they abandon it, as it says: the righteous walk in them, but sinners stumble in them."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "The phrase לחם חום is opaque, possibly corrupt or an idiom no longer recoverable; rendered hyper-literally. 'The lamed' refers to a grammatical pattern/class."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:06.883812816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}